  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following statements(s) is/are true? \"Internal energy of an ideal gas ...........\""
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "decreases in an isothermal process.",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "remains constant in an isothermal process.",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "increases in an isobaric process.",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "decreases in an isobaric expansion.",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\because$ Internal energy of an ideal gas depends only on the temperature of gas.\r\n$$\r\nE_{\\text {in }} \\propto T\r\n$$"
  }
